# app/ is the ACR retrieval build context. This is an allowlist: exclude every
# file by default, then re-include only the exact files the retrieval container
# image must consume. Do not add ingestion source, local settings, protected
# data, certificates, tests, caches, Kubernetes manifests, or documentation.

*

# Required retrieval image inputs.
!retrieval/
!retrieval/*.py
!retrieval/catalog.example.json
!retrieval/requirements.txt
!retrieval/Dockerfile
!source_registry.py
!cosmos_connection.py

# Explicit re-excludes for files that must never enter the ACR build context.
retrieval/.dockerignore
retrieval/kubernetes/
retrieval/kubernetes/**
retrieval/*.md
**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyi
